          "relation": "implies",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 1467,
            "text": "theorem profile_uniform_cone {C : ℝ} (hC : 0 < C) (d : TailData) (y0 : ℝ) :\n    ∃ ε m : ℝ, 0 < ε ∧ 0 < m ∧ ∀ η ∈ Icc (-1 : ℝ) 1, ∀ x : ℝ, |x| < ε →\n      m ≤ profileAngularFactor C d y0 (η, x) ∧\n      m ≤ profileSpeed C d y0 (η, x) - 2 ∧ m ≤ profileConeGap C d y0 (η, x)"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
